WEBVTT

1
00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:03.500
In these verses of the tenth chapter, Arjun

2
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.000
humbly requests

3
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.250
Lord Krishna to describe His divine vibhutis

4
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:09.375
and transcendental powers

5
00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:12.458
in detail.

6
00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:16.375
Fully assured of Lord Krishna's supremacy,

7
00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:17.250
Arjun expresses a deep

8
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.458
longing to hear more

9
00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:21.250
about His many

10
00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:22.916
divine glories.

11
00:01:27.791 --> 00:01:30.791
Arjun requests Lord Krishna
to describe His vibhutis,

12
00:01:30.791 --> 00:01:31.375
that is,

13
00:01:31.375 --> 00:01:33.583
His divine glories,

14
00:01:33.583 --> 00:01:36.583
in detail,

15
00:01:36.583 --> 00:01:37.541
through which

16
00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:39.833
He pervades all of creation

17
00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:42.625
and sustains the universe.

18
00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:44.041
Although Arjun

19
00:01:44.041 --> 00:01:45.666
has already heard

20
00:01:45.666 --> 00:01:48.291
that Lord Krishna is the source of all creation,

21
00:01:48.291 --> 00:01:52.041
'aham sarvasya prabhavah',

22
00:01:52.041 --> 00:01:55.666
yet he desires an even more detailed account.

23
00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:57.958
His question does not arise from doubt,

24
00:01:57.958 --> 00:02:00.000
but it arises from a desire to meditate

25
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.916
deeply on Lord Krishna's presence in the world,

26
00:02:01.916 --> 00:02:08.416
and to guide others in His devotion.

27
00:02:08.416 --> 00:02:11.041
In verse 10.17,

28
00:02:11.041 --> 00:02:13.708
this is reflected in his question –

29
00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:15.291
'O Supreme Lord,

30
00:02:15.291 --> 00:02:16.291
in which forms

31
00:02:16.291 --> 00:02:20.041
may I contemplate You?'

32
00:02:20.041 --> 00:02:21.083
Arjun's request

33
00:02:21.083 --> 00:02:24.625
also reveals his compassion for others.

34
00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:25.583
He wishes to make

35
00:02:25.583 --> 00:02:27.833
Lord Krishna's transcendental nature

36
00:02:27.833 --> 00:02:29.125
accessible to

37
00:02:29.125 --> 00:02:31.916
ordinary people.

38
00:02:31.916 --> 00:02:33.625
In verse 10.18,

39
00:02:33.625 --> 00:02:36.208
Arjun acknowledges his unquenchable

40
00:02:36.208 --> 00:02:39.750
eagerness to hear about Lord Krishna.

41
00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:42.083
He compares Lord Krishna's words

42
00:02:42.083 --> 00:02:43.666
to amrita – nectar.

43
00:02:43.666 --> 00:02:45.291
He declares that

44
00:02:45.291 --> 00:02:48.166
the more he hears, the more

45
00:02:48.166 --> 00:02:51.875
he wants to hear.

46
00:02:51.875 --> 00:02:53.875
This reveals an essential

47
00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:56.833
quality of Lord Krishna's teachings.

48
00:02:56.833 --> 00:03:01.666
They are ever fresh and give boundless joy.

49
00:03:01.666 --> 00:03:03.750
Unlike worldly subjects,

50
00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.791
which lose their charm over time,

51
00:03:06.791 --> 00:03:09.000
Lord Krishna's spiritual knowledge

52
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.583
and divine pastimes every time

53
00:03:10.583 --> 00:03:14.916
they are heard reveal a new meaning.

54
00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:16.583
Arjun's questions serve both

55
00:03:16.583 --> 00:03:18.000
a personal

56
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.958
and a universal purpose.

57
00:03:20.958 --> 00:03:22.041
For himself,

58
00:03:22.041 --> 00:03:24.375
he wishes to immerse his mind in continuous

59
00:03:24.375 --> 00:03:27.166
contemplation of Lord Krishna.

60
00:03:27.166 --> 00:03:30.083
For others – those absorbed

61
00:03:30.083 --> 00:03:31.666
in material attachment –

62
00:03:31.666 --> 00:03:34.083
how they may connect with the Lord,

63
00:03:34.083 --> 00:03:36.750
for that he seeks a framework,

64
00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:38.375
so that those people too

65
00:03:38.375 --> 00:03:41.750
can recognise Lord Krishna's
presence in this universe

66
00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:44.541
and ultimately connect with Him.

67
00:03:44.541 --> 00:03:46.958
His request for a detailed description

68
00:03:46.958 --> 00:03:50.875
ensures that Lord Krishna's
teachings remain accessible.

69
00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:54.500
Though transcendental, yet through relatable

70
00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.291
examples,

71
00:03:56.291 --> 00:03:58.500
they can be understood.

72
00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.000
By hearing about these glories, Arjun

73
00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.875
and all listeners

74
00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:05.166
can develop exclusive devotion

75
00:04:05.166 --> 00:04:06.958
and joyfully

76
00:04:06.958 --> 00:04:11.000
meditate on the Lord,
whose glories are boundless

77
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:15.166
and whose words are nectar for the soul.

78
00:04:15.166 --> 00:04:17.166
In the coming verses, Lord Krishna

79
00:04:17.166 --> 00:04:19.916
will respond to Arjun's prayer

80
00:04:19.916 --> 00:04:22.500
and describe His vibhutis

81
00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:23.708
in detail.

82
00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:32.125
In your personal life,

83
00:04:32.125 --> 00:04:33.833
the kind of curiosity

84
00:04:33.833 --> 00:04:36.708
you develop,

85
00:04:36.708 --> 00:04:44.416
that is how your destiny will take shape.

86
00:04:44.416 --> 00:04:46.708
See Arjun's

87
00:04:46.708 --> 00:04:50.250
deep eagerness to know more

88
00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:54.750
about My divine glories.

89
00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:56.166
In this spiritual

90
00:04:56.166 --> 00:05:01.416
curiosity, a wonderful power is hidden,

91
00:05:01.416 --> 00:05:04.750
one that transforms life.

92
00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:09.625
This is a thirst,

93
00:05:09.625 --> 00:05:13.333
a longing to know more

94
00:05:13.333 --> 00:05:16.791
about great truths.

95
00:05:16.791 --> 00:05:19.958
This curiosity frees you from the ordinary

96
00:05:19.958 --> 00:05:24.000
matters of life.

97
00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.583
Within it

98
00:05:25.583 --> 00:05:29.875
lies the wonderful ability

99
00:05:29.875 --> 00:05:33.625
to elevate your life.

100
00:05:33.625 --> 00:05:35.833
When your curiosity

101
00:05:35.833 --> 00:05:38.333
is only for material goals

102
00:05:38.333 --> 00:05:42.291
or material subjects,

103
00:05:42.291 --> 00:05:48.083
it often becomes a cause of dissatisfaction.

104
00:05:48.083 --> 00:05:50.833
Such achievements

105
00:05:50.833 --> 00:05:54.583
and wealth can bring momentary pleasure,

106
00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:58.791
but the craving never ends,

107
00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:00.375
and you

108
00:06:00.375 --> 00:06:04.375
remain unfulfilled.

109
00:06:04.375 --> 00:06:05.916
Whereas

110
00:06:05.916 --> 00:06:09.875
spiritual curiosity brings such joy

111
00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:13.291
and such a sense of purpose,

112
00:06:13.291 --> 00:06:18.333
that only grows with time.

113
00:06:18.333 --> 00:06:21.583
The more you learn,

114
00:06:21.583 --> 00:06:23.458
the more

115
00:06:23.458 --> 00:06:27.000
you want to go deeper.

116
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:30.916
This cycle of exploration and curiosity

117
00:06:30.916 --> 00:06:34.250
purifies your heart

118
00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:38.791
and elevates your consciousness.

119
00:06:38.791 --> 00:06:41.333
The wonderful thing is,

120
00:06:41.333 --> 00:06:43.625
that if you direct your curiosity

121
00:06:43.625 --> 00:06:45.458
toward understanding

122
00:06:45.458 --> 00:06:49.375
spiritual truths,

123
00:06:49.375 --> 00:06:51.916
it will naturally

124
00:06:51.916 --> 00:06:57.375
lead your life on the path
of peace and contentment.

125
00:06:57.375 --> 00:06:59.958
Like Arjun,

126
00:06:59.958 --> 00:07:03.166
receive knowledge with humility

127
00:07:03.166 --> 00:07:07.000
and an open heart.

128
00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.875
You will find

129
00:07:08.875 --> 00:07:11.750
that the eagerness to learn

130
00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:16.166
will carry you toward lasting joy.

131
00:07:16.166 --> 00:07:19.041
Use your thirst for knowledge

132
00:07:19.041 --> 00:07:21.833
to seek higher purpose

133
00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:27.791
and to understand the deeper meaning of life.

134
00:07:27.791 --> 00:07:28.791
This will transform

135
00:07:28.791 --> 00:07:32.500
not just your actions,

136
00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:37.625
but your entire being.

137
00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:46.583
Let us reflect on a simple thing.

138
00:07:46.583 --> 00:07:48.000
You

139
00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:52.583
and your family, what topics do you discuss?

140
00:07:52.583 --> 00:07:54.416
The subjects

141
00:07:54.416 --> 00:07:58.541
in which you spend your time,

142
00:07:58.541 --> 00:08:03.208
those are the ones that shape your life.

143
00:08:03.208 --> 00:08:04.291
In family

144
00:08:04.291 --> 00:08:06.958
and social life,

145
00:08:06.958 --> 00:08:10.166
the things you adopt –

146
00:08:10.166 --> 00:08:11.666
these things

147
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:13.791
deeply influence

148
00:08:13.791 --> 00:08:16.583
your character,

149
00:08:16.583 --> 00:08:21.416
and also the values and lessons

150
00:08:21.416 --> 00:08:22.791
that you pass on

151
00:08:22.791 --> 00:08:25.916
to others.

152
00:08:25.916 --> 00:08:28.208
Spiritual subjects

153
00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:30.416
are special,

154
00:08:30.416 --> 00:08:32.250
like

155
00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:37.041
the teachings I gave to Arjun.

156
00:08:37.041 --> 00:08:40.250
They give deep joy.

157
00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:42.666
They increase the eagerness

158
00:08:42.666 --> 00:08:46.250
to learn even more.

159
00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.125
Arjun's desire to hear

160
00:08:48.125 --> 00:08:52.708
about My divine glories was not casual

161
00:08:52.708 --> 00:08:55.458
or superficial.

162
00:08:55.458 --> 00:08:56.625
He wanted to

163
00:08:56.625 --> 00:09:00.500
understand it in depth.

164
00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:03.416
He knew how greatly this knowledge

165
00:09:03.416 --> 00:09:08.291
would enrich his devotion and his life.

166
00:09:08.291 --> 00:09:13.083
Now compare this to material subjects.

167
00:09:13.083 --> 00:09:14.958
These subjects may entertain

168
00:09:14.958 --> 00:09:16.791
for some time,

169
00:09:16.791 --> 00:09:20.500
keep you busy for a while,

170
00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:24.500
but often in the end leave behind

171
00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:28.958
a feeling of emptiness or boredom.

172
00:09:28.958 --> 00:09:32.750
They make you restless.

173
00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:36.166
See – in a family where mother

174
00:09:36.166 --> 00:09:40.166
and father have deep conversations
with their children

175
00:09:40.166 --> 00:09:45.750
and discuss life's important questions,

176
00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:49.041
there the children become so thoughtful

177
00:09:49.041 --> 00:09:51.958
and wise.

178
00:09:51.958 --> 00:09:53.666
The capacity within them

179
00:09:53.666 --> 00:09:57.666
to understand life's deeper meaning develops.

180
00:09:57.666 --> 00:10:00.041
In the family environment,

181
00:10:00.041 --> 00:10:03.500
encourage meaningful conversations.

182
00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.625
Share spiritual stories, values,

183
00:10:06.625 --> 00:10:09.291
and such teachings

184
00:10:09.291 --> 00:10:13.750
that inspire curiosity and growth.

185
00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.458
Just as Arjun

186
00:10:15.458 --> 00:10:21.833
wished to go into the depth of My words.

187
00:10:21.833 --> 00:10:24.208
This awareness elevates

188
00:10:24.208 --> 00:10:27.625
not only your own life,

189
00:10:27.625 --> 00:10:32.666
but also the lives of those around you

190
00:10:32.666 --> 00:10:34.750
it brightens.

191
00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.375
It creates a foundation of knowledge

192
00:10:37.375 --> 00:10:40.416
and mutual love,

193
00:10:40.416 --> 00:10:43.333
that benefits everyone.

194
00:10:43.333 --> 00:10:46.041
Remember –

195
00:10:46.041 --> 00:10:47.250
the more deeply

196
00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:50.375
you absorb knowledge,

197
00:10:50.375 --> 00:10:55.875
the more the quality of your life will be refined.

198
00:10:55.875 --> 00:10:59.333
Learn what is wholesome,
teach what is wholesome.

199
00:10:59.333 --> 00:11:01.916
Let the light of divine knowledge

200
00:11:01.916 --> 00:11:04.000
spread all around.

201
00:11:08.916 --> 00:11:12.625
Look at the successful fruit seller

202
00:11:12.625 --> 00:11:18.166
who learns something new about
fruits every day.

203
00:11:18.166 --> 00:11:20.875
When are they in season for health?

204
00:11:20.875 --> 00:11:22.750
How are they good?

205
00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:25.791
How to keep them fresh?

206
00:11:25.791 --> 00:11:28.875
He also learns from his customers,

207
00:11:28.875 --> 00:11:30.125
and that is why

208
00:11:30.125 --> 00:11:34.625
his business keeps growing and flourishing.

209
00:11:34.625 --> 00:11:36.833
In the professional world,

210
00:11:36.833 --> 00:11:39.500
one important quality

211
00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:43.583
that sets successful people apart,

212
00:11:43.583 --> 00:11:45.083
that is

213
00:11:45.083 --> 00:11:47.416
their intense

214
00:11:47.416 --> 00:11:52.750
eagerness to keep learning.

215
00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.291
Arjun

216
00:11:54.291 --> 00:11:57.208
already understands

217
00:11:57.208 --> 00:12:00.500
My supreme position.

218
00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:02.750
Yet even then

219
00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:06.625
he remains eager to hear more

220
00:12:06.625 --> 00:12:10.541
about My divine glories.

221
00:12:10.541 --> 00:12:12.208
By doing so,

222
00:12:12.208 --> 00:12:15.958
he reveals the beauty of this quality.

223
00:12:15.958 --> 00:12:20.833
His curiosity does not come from doubt.

224
00:12:20.833 --> 00:12:25.250
It arises from a genuine desire to deepen

225
00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:27.958
his understanding

226
00:12:27.958 --> 00:12:31.666
and to share the knowledge he has received

227
00:12:31.666 --> 00:12:35.583
with others.

228
00:12:35.583 --> 00:12:37.208
In the same way,

229
00:12:37.208 --> 00:12:39.625
in your profession,

230
00:12:39.625 --> 00:12:42.291
being eager to learn

231
00:12:42.291 --> 00:12:45.333
keeps you continuously growing,

232
00:12:45.333 --> 00:12:50.875
however skilled or experienced you may be.

233
00:12:50.875 --> 00:12:53.416
The best leaders

234
00:12:53.416 --> 00:12:56.750
and professionals

235
00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:59.625
are those who continuously ask questions,

236
00:12:59.625 --> 00:13:02.250
seek new perspectives,

237
00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:06.375
and find new paths of improvement.

238
00:13:06.375 --> 00:13:08.833
Just as Arjun

239
00:13:08.833 --> 00:13:12.833
finds joy in hearing My words,

240
00:13:12.833 --> 00:13:16.291
in the same way, when you embrace

241
00:13:16.291 --> 00:13:20.875
learning as a continuous process,

242
00:13:20.875 --> 00:13:21.958
this process

243
00:13:21.958 --> 00:13:27.416
brings new energy to your work,

244
00:13:27.416 --> 00:13:31.583
gives you a deeper vision.
